# pseudocode source: chapters/ch65.tex:129
# caption: Residualize known expression syntax into stack bytecode.

REQUIRE finite expression tree with constants, input, addition, and multiplication
ENSURE bytecode with one result and the same integer expression meaning
FUNCTION Emit(e)
  IF e is a constant THEN
    append a constant-push instruction
  ELSE IF e is the dynamic input THEN
    append an input-push instruction
  ELSE
    Emit(left child of e); Emit(right child of e)
    append the corresponding binary operation
  END IF
END FUNCTION

